              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 15:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 1:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya higo Daudi na Aiziraeli osi aphiya Jerusalemu, yani Jebusi. Ajebusi ndio ariokala achisagala mumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hinyo enyezi a Jebusi achimuamba Daudi, “Mumu kundainjira bii.” Ela hata hivyo Daudi waiteka yo ngome ya Sayuni, yani mudzi wa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi kala akaamba, “Yeyesi ndiye kala wa kpwandza kuapiga Ajebusi andakala mkpwulu wa majeshi.” Ndipho Joabu mwana wa Seruya, achikala wa kpwandza kpwendapigana, naye achikala mkpwulu wa majeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi wasagala mumo ngomeni ndiyo mana uchiihwa mudzi wa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiudzenga nyo mudzi kuuzunguluka hangu Milo. Joabu naye achidzenga luphya seemu zirizosala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi wazidi kuhenda nguvu, kpwa mana Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi kala a phamwenga naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinya ndinyo akulu a masujaa ariokala na Daudi. Hinya ndio ariomuunga mkpwono wa nguvu katika ufalumewe, phamwenga na Iziraeli yosi, ili amuhende mfalume, kulengana na neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu arirorigomba kuhusu Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hino ndiyo idadi ya masujaa a Daudi; Jashobeamu, Muhakimoni, ndiye kala ni mkpwulu wa “Hinya ahahu,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hara mirongo mihahu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hebu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hara ahahu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; tafusiri mwenga ya kare (soma",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 23:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ").",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hiye waolaga atu magana manane, kpwa wakati mmwenga, kpwa kuhumira fumore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wa phiriwe kahi ya hara masujaa ahahu ni Eliazari mwana wa Dodo wa mbari ya Ahohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuyu wakala ni mmwenga wa hara masujaa ahahu. Naye kala a phamwenga na Daudi ko Pasidamimu, phatu ambapho Afilisti kala akakusanyika tayari kpwa viha. Hiko kala kuna munda uriokala u tele shayiri na Aiziraeli achimbira nyo Afilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela aho aima kahi-kahi ya nyo munda, achiuhehera na achiaolaga nyo Afilisti. Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiapha ushindi mkpwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga hara ahahu kahi ya mirongo mihahu ambao kala ni akulu, atserera mwamba achiphiya kpwa Daudi, kpwenye pango ra Adulamu wakati jeshi ra Afilisti kala rikapiga kambi Dete ra Arafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, Daudi kala a hiko ngomeni, na chikosi chimwenga cha jeshi ra Afilisti kala chi Bethilehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achikala na chiru achiambira atue achiamba, “Ni ani ndiyeweza kunipha madzi ga kunwa kula chisima chiricho phephi na ryango ra Bethilehemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho hinyo masujaa ahahu adudula kahi ya jeshi ra Afilisti, achendaheka madzi kula kpwa hicho chisima cha Bethilehemu, chiricho phephi na ryango, achigahala achimrehera Daudi. Ela Daudi warema kuganwa, wagamwaga dza sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achiamba, “Mlungu wangu asinijaliye kuhenda dzambo hiri. Dze! Ndanwadze milatso ya hinyo atu achiozindza maisha gao kpwendaheka madzi higa? Manage akagareha kpwa kuhatarisha maisha gao.” Kpwa hivyo Daudi warema kuganwa. Higo ndigo arigohenda hinyo masujaa ahahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai, mwanao wa Joabu, wakala ni mkpwulu wa hara masujaa ahahu. Kpwa kuhumira fumore, waolaga atu magana mahahu. Iye wakala mutu wa kumanyikana sawa na hara ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania inaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ahahu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai waishimiwa kano mbiri zaidi ya hara ahahu, achikala mkpwulu wao, dzagbwe kayakala dza nyo ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, mwana wa Jehoyada kala ni sujaa kula Kabuseeli, ariyehenda mambo makulu. Ndiye ariyeolaga masujaa airi kula Moabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ana airi a Arieli",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ". Arieli taimanyikana manage.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Piya wakati wanjina wakpwendaolaga simba ndani ya dibwa wakati wa barafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tsona achiolaga Mmisiri, mutu mure sana, urewe kala ni mikono mitsano. Hiye Mmisiri kala ana fumo dzire dza muhi wa mfumadzi, ela Benaya wamlunga na gongo, achendamfuta fumo kula mwakpwe mkpwononi na achimuolaga naro mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higo ndigo arigohenda Benaya mwana wa Jehoyada, na achimanyikana dza hara masujaa ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye kala anaishimiwa kuriko hara masujaa mirongo mihahu, ela kala si mmwenga wa hara ahahu. Naye Daudi wamuika akale mkpwulu wa arindzie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
